{"height": 7, "weight": 160, "base_experience": 147, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "hp", "value": 2}], "genus": "Blade Quill Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 15, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["flying"], "gender_rate": 1, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "フクスロー"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Fukuthrow"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "빼미스로우"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "投羽梟"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Efflèche"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Arboretoss"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Dartrix"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Dartrix"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "フクスロー"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "投羽枭"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Dartrix"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["sun"], "text": "A bit of a dandy, it spends its free time preening its wings. Its preoccupation with any dirt on its plumage can leave it unable to battle."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "It throws sharp feathers called blade quills at enemies or prey. It seldom misses."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "This narcissistic Pokémon is a clean freak. If you don’t groom it diligently, it will stop listening to you."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "Supremely sensitive to the presence of others, it can detect opponents standing behind it, flinging its sharp feathers to take them out."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "It throws one knifelike feather after another at its enemies, and each one precisely strikes a weak point. These feathers are known as blade quills."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "It never slacks when it comes to the task of cleaning its feathers. Thorough preening keeps it looking spiffy and its blade quills nice and sharp."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Regularly basks in sunlight to gather power—presumably due to the frigid climate. Nonetheless, the edges of the blade quills set into its wings are keen as ever."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ix": {"scarlet-violet": {"normal"